'''Mini Agent Mission''' is a map on [[Minecraft Education]].

== Summary ==
{{Expand section}}
The player will spawn near an agent-like NPC. It will explain the goal of the activity. Then, the player will be prompted to choose between three challenges: ''The'' ''Smart Farming Agent'', ''The'' ''Night Guardian Agent'', and ''The'' ''Eco-Cleanup Agent.''

== Quotes ==
{{Quote|The Problem: A drought is threatening the village's food supply!
Your Mission: Build an AI agent that can autonomously care for crops by:
* Checking if soil is dry
* Watering plants when needed
* Planting seeds in empty spots
* Harvesting ripe crops
Real-World Connection: Learn how AI helps farmers feed the world!|Agent}}{{Quote|The Problem: Villages are vulnerable to dangers at night!
Your Mission: Create an AI agent that:
* Patrols the village after dark
* Places torches in dark areas
* Rings the bell if danger is spotted
* Keeps villagers safe
Real-World Connection: Explore how AI enhances security and safety!|Agent}}{{Quote|The Problem: Our environment needs protection from litter!
Your Mission: Design an AI agent that:
* Collects trash items
* Sorts materials into recycling chests
* Identifies pollution sources
* Keeps spaces clean
Real-World Connection: Discover how AI helps protect our planet!|Agent}}

